  <h1>License terms and privacy notice</h1>
  <p>These terms apply to OSMOS Circuit Instrument 1.0. Gumroad asks you to accept them at checkout.</p>
  <h2>Software license</h2>
  <p>Purchasers may install the licensed version of OSMOS on Macs they manage and use it for personal, professional, and commercial work. Creators retain the rights to their work, subject to any terms that apply to materials they use. Copyright in the software remains with its rights holder.</p>
  <p>Sharing purchase keys or redistributing the plug-in or installer is prohibited. The accompanying third-party license notices govern the use of third-party software. The demo recordings on the product page are available for listening. Reproduction, sampling, and redistribution require separate permission.</p>
  <h2>Free trial, payment, and updates</h2>
  <p>The free trial lasts 14 days from activation of the trial. The full version is a one-time purchase of US$249. The license for the purchased version has no expiry date.</p>
  <p>Future major versions may be sold separately. Gumroad provides the download and license key after payment and shows applicable taxes, currency, and the total at checkout. To request a refund within 14 days of purchase, reply to your Gumroad receipt and include the order details. Statutory consumer rights apply.</p>
  <h2>License verification and data</h2>
  <p>On initial activation, the plug-in sends the entered purchase key and product identifier to Gumroad over HTTPS. OSMOS stores the verification result and the trial start time on your Mac. License verification leaves the key, the Gumroad response body, and your creative files out of local license storage. Tracks, MIDI, DAW projects, and audio stay on your device during verification.</p>
  <p>Gumroad handles purchase information under its own policy. <a href="https://gumroad.com/privacy">Gumroad Privacy Policy</a></p>
<h2 id="seller">Seller information</h2><p>The seller is AOI Future / Shugo Nozaki. Contact <a href="mailto:legal@aoifuture.com">legal@aoifuture.com</a> with questions before purchase. The seller’s address and telephone number will be provided promptly upon request. Gumroad displays the payment options and timing at checkout.</p>
